  "newDiscoveriesThisRound": [
    "batch multi-itemId queries em /accounts e /investments",
    "investments response inclui transactions inline (campo transactions[])",
    "POST /api/connect-token com itemId no body = fluxo de sincronizacao/atualizacao",
    "LOANS: coletado pelo Pluggy durante sync mas nao exposto como endpoint separado no dashboard consumidor",
    "PAYMENT_DATA: incorporado no campo transaction.paymentData (payer, paymentMethod, receiver, boletoMetadata)",
    "BROKERAGE_NOTE: incorporado em investmentTransaction.brokerageNumber (confirmado para EQUITY/STOCK)",
    "Tipo EQUITY/STOCK confirmado nos investimentos Nubank (ALLD3)",
    "investment.transactions[].expenses: objeto com breakdown detalhado de impostos (incomeTax, brokerageFee, etc.)",
    "identity.qualifications.informedIncome: renda declarada com amount e frequency",
    "identity.financialRelationships.productsServicesType: lista de produtos financeiros do usuario no banco",
    "account.bankData: transferNumber, closingBalance, automaticallyInvestedBalance, overdraftContractedLimit",
    "account.creditData.disaggregatedCreditLimits: array de limites por modalidade",
    "billId em creditCardMetadata: referencia UUID da fatura, sem endpoint /bills disponivel no proxy consumidor",
    "Atualizar button flow: POST /api/connect-token{itemId} -> Pluggy Widget iframe -> re-auth bancaria"
